{"title":"Special Event: Autumn hike through Mt. Pleasant Cemetary to Brickworks","startsAt":"2026-10-25T13:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-25T15:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"A spooky hike where we can enjoy the changing leaves in full autumn.\n\nWe will start with an inspirational walk through Mt. Pleasant Cemetary and then continuing on to the Brickworks to enjoy the remainder of the changing leaves through the Moore Ravine.\n\n**When:** Sunday, October 25, start at 1:30pm\n**Where:** Gather by the entrance on Yonge St. ([https://maps.app.goo.gl/Shqzx7fxMCBQvWJy8](https://maps.app.goo.gl/Shqzx7fxMCBQvWJy8), south of Davisville Station).\n\n**Mt. Pleasant Cemetery:** ([https://www.mountpleasantgroup.com/Locations/Cemeteries/Mount-Pleasant.aspx](https://www.mountpleasantgroup.com/Locations/Cemeteries/Mount-Pleasant.aspx \"https://www.mountpleasantgroup.com/Locations/Cemeteries/Mount-Pleasant.aspx\"))\n\n**Evergreen Brickworks:**\nhttps://www.evergreen.ca/stories/your-ultimate-fall-guide-to-evergreen-brick-works/\n\nSend me a direct message if you have any questions.","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"Riverdale Park 5K","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/7/8/b/highres_530571083.jpeg"}